# shadcn/ui Component Preference

- Prefer using existing shadcn/ui components from `components/ui/*` before creating custom interactive UI implementations.
- For overlays (popover, dialog, dropdown, tooltip), use shadcn wrappers around Radix primitives instead of manual positioning logic.
- When a requested shadcn component is missing, add the standard shadcn file in `components/ui/` and required utilities in `lib/utils.ts`.
- Keep existing project styling, tokens, and responsive behavior when migrating to shadcn components.
